<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: SOCCER-IRELAND BEAT MACEDONIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRELAND BEAT MACEDONIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland beat Macedonia 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group eight qualifier at</p>
<p>Lansdowne Road on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Jason McAteer (8th min), Tony Cascarino (47th,</p>
<p>70th).</p>
<p>Attendance: 31,600</p>
</text>
